    <text>
        <body>
            <div type="edition">
            <ab>Transcription goes here</ab></div>
            
            <div type="translation">
            <p></p></div>

            <div type="commentary">
            <p>Cast of a bilingual inscription from a stone tomb in Kaş, Turkey, ancient
                    Antiphellos. The inscription is written in Lycian on the upper register and in
                    Greek on the lower. It records that Iktasla of Antiphellos had the monument made
                    for himself, his wife, and his children.</p></div>
            

